<div class="wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal"><span style="display: block;">This authentic menemen recipe is a one-pan Turkish egg dish made by gently scrambling eggs into sauted onions, green peppers, and tomatoes until just set and spoonable. Serve it family-style with crusty bread on the side for breakfast, brunch, or for a light lunch.</span></div>
